### =========================================================================
### Attendance System API - HTTP Client Test File
### Use with VS Code "REST Client" or "Thunder Client" extensions
### =========================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api
@authToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. HEALTH / STATUS CHECK
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### API Status
GET {{baseUrl}}
Accept: application/json

### Laravel Health Check
GET http://localhost:8000/up
Accept: application/json

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. AUTHENTICATION
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Login as Administrator
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@attendance.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login as Teacher
# @name loginTeacher
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "teacher@attendance.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login as Student
# @name loginStudent
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "student@attendance.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Get Current User Profile (Using Token from Login)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. ADMIN ENDPOINTS
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### List All Users
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### List All Classes
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/classes
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### List All Subjects
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/subjects
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Get Dashboard Overview Analytics
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/reports/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Get Attendance Reports
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/reports/attendance
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. TEACHER ENDPOINTS
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### List Attendance Sessions
GET {{baseUrl}}/teacher/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### List Teacher Leave Requests
GET {{baseUrl}}/teacher/leave-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. STUDENT ENDPOINTS
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Get Student Attendance History
GET {{baseUrl}}/student/history
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Get Student Attendance Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/student/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json
